==Enemy==
Ghost Doge is the [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] variant of [[Doge]], and is two times more powerful in terms of health and damage. It's still a very weak enemy, though.

==Strategy==
Since it is still much like the regular Doge, almost anything can kill it with ease.

